                        "entry_id": "b0015773-a6ff-3063-8645-070c79793baf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A worker for a company that supplies gas (in the sense of the gaseous fuel), especially one who visits premises to read the meter, test appliances etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
